00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:33,360
and work at big scale and asynchronous

291
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:35,040
and all the things that we talked about.

292
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,640
So, when the internet was designed,

293
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:39,840
it also introduced all sorts of different ways of thinking,

294
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:41,200
which is kind of interesting.

295
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:43,440
And nowadays, all sorts of modern systems,

