00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:47,280
like cloud services, cloud computing, AI training, whatever,

297
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:49,840
all of these other fields have actually started

298
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,920
to learn lessons from the internet.

299
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:54,000
So, the internet was the first system that learned

300
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,880
how to do things like handle failures at scale,

