00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,520
So, that's kind of interesting,

306
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:12,080
that the things you learn are also applicable

307
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:13,840
in lots of other fields.

308
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:17,360
So, as mentioned before, some of the ways of thinking

309
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,200
that were pioneered by the internet

310
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,040
and now used all over the place,

